{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "985456b4-5783-843a-a4ed-f75265a926fe",
  "created_at": "2026-01-21T11:17:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Janice Chase",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:13:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Owen. Please excuse me for bothering you. I am calling about the noise. There is a construction crew near my house, and they start working before seven in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:13:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Before seven. Let me make sure I have that right. A construction crew, and they're starting early in the morning. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:14:06-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that is right. Before seven, with the machines and the hammering and the trucks backing up with the beeping. Today it was ten minutes to seven, I looked at the clock. And please understand, this is the third day now. Three days in a row."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three days. All right. And where is this happening? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:14:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, I am at 393 Spring Street. The work is right next to us, on the same block. I live in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:14:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three nine three Spring Street. Got it. And do you know what the job is? Is it a house, or a road crew, or something else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:14:47-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Excuse me, I am not sure. I think it is a house, they are building at the back, and there is a big truck. I did not go ask them. I do not want a problem, but I am very tired, because every morning they wake me up and I cannot sleep again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I understand. Um, let me type that in. Give me one second, I'm a little slow on this form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:15:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course, take your time. [pause] Please, I would like to ask that you make a report. A real report, so that it is written down somewhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:15:25-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's what I'm doing. I'm taking a noise complaint report. Construction starting before seven a.m., three days running, at three nine three Spring Street. Can I get your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:15:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. My name is Janice Chase. Chase, C-H-A-S-E."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:15:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Janice Chase. And a callback number, in case someone needs to follow up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:15:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:15:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0162. I have that. Now, I'll be honest, I can't tell you right now what time the crew is allowed to start, that's something the inspections side would sort out. I'll send this to them so somebody can check."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, may I ask, how long will it take? Because tomorrow they will start again. I have lived on Aquidneck Island all my life, it is the only place I have ever lived, and I know there is always building. I do not mind the work. But before seven, it is too early for a neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:16:24-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I hear you. I can't promise you a day for when someone calls back, but it's in the system now with today's date, and that's the record you wanted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. Please, if someone can come in the morning, they will hear it themselves. That is the best time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:16:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes. Early morning visit would let them hear it. Anything else you want me to add?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for your patience, Owen. I hope they can stop it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-21T11:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Chase. Take care, and have a good rest of your day."
    }
  ],
